                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9146d2b1-cbee-4766-8654-3797a0703b73",
                                "sense_id": "9c1a636d-a765-3b90-9ec0-41d0301cc6bc",
                                "text": "I'm low key salty about the way that nigga did you but it seems like he still cares about you.",
                                "translation": "對於那傢伙對待你的方式，我心裡其實有點不爽，但看樣子他似乎還是很在乎你。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7977ac40-3641-4b89-b4a0-5b3acabc49db",
                                "sense_id": "9c1a636d-a765-3b90-9ec0-41d0301cc6bc",
                                "text": "Before I open the messages, I disable the activity notification so no one will know I'm low-key obsessed with a party I didn't get to attend.",
                                "translation": "在點開訊息之前，我先關閉了動態通知，這樣就沒人會知道我其實私心非常執著於一場我沒能參加的派對。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f3203b3d-f352-4a4e-990d-bcbaf80010dc",
                                "sense_id": "9c1a636d-a765-3b90-9ec0-41d0301cc6bc",
                                "text": "“Is this a social experiment? I’m 95 percent sure it is,” said Alex Feinstein, an accountant. “I low-key think it’s an N.Y.U. production.”",
                                "translation": "「這是場社會實驗嗎？我有九成五的把握它是，」會計師亞歷克斯·費恩斯坦說，「我私下覺得這是紐約大學的作品。」"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2bf98f2e-010f-3325-8fd7-21efd6b62aa0",
                        "entry_id": "d0dee2ee-ff64-3769-be0e-ad4bd37435a9",
                        "glosses": [
